cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use QSOL UFF, cite this software release and the primary scientific sources for every model, catalogue, statistical method, and nonclaim calibration reference used. The assigned v5.3.0 Zenodo version DOI is 10.5281/zenodo.22026554; the immutable v5.2.0 DOI remains 10.5281/zenodo.21911644."
title: "QSOL UFF v5.3.0: Nonclaim Calibration and Evidence-Scope Discipline for Reproducible Astrophysics"
type: software
